Run char_cdb.pl (modified from LP kit WS) to generate Celtic database *.cdb and *.cdb.txt.

The inputs are:
standard cells netlist, transistor models,
given temperatures,
and slow.lib, fast.lib,

The outputs are:
slow.cdb (WC generated from slow.lib and 125C)
fast.cdb (BC generated from fast.lib and 0C)
*.cdb.txt (ASCII format cdb)
